{"id": "t032-001", "text": "Francesca has her second interview at the bank on Thursday at 10am. She sounded really nervous about the presentation part. Remind me to text her good luck on Wednesday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second interview at the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 10am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t032-002", "text": "Kofi started at the agency on Monday. He says the team is lovely but the commute is brutal.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kofi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "started at the agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "team is lovely", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "commute is brutal", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t032-003", "text": "Camila's boss announced he's retiring at Christmas. She thinks she might be in line for his job.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "might be in line for his job", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t032-005", "text": "Call with Florin this afternoon. His leaving drinks are on Friday at 6pm at the Crown, and he starts the new role in Bristol the Monday after. He's a bit sad to be leaving the team, especially Callum, who he's worked with for nearly six years. He said Bristol was too good to turn down though, and his partner already has a job lined up there.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Florin", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this afternoon"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 6pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new role in Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Monday after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit sad", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Callum", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worked with for nearly six years", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "has a job lined up", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t032-007", "text": "Krisztina is applying for the head of finance job internally. Interviews are next Tuesday and Wednesday, and she's on Tuesday at 2pm. She's worried because the other candidate is her manager's favourite and has been there longer. She's been preparing every evening this week. I should offer to go through some practice questions with her on Sunday afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "head of finance job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Interviews", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday and Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening this week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to go through some practice questions with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t032-008", "text": "Amy mentioned her dad finally retires next Friday after 32 years at the council. They're doing a family meal on Saturday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retires", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "32 years at the council", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "family meal", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday evening", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t032-017", "text": "Varun's brother Anil has a phone interview with Google on Monday at 2pm. Varun said Anil hasn't slept properly all week and keeps rewriting his answers. It's for a data engineering role in their Dublin office, so he'd have to move if he gets it. Their mum is already planning the leaving party. Remind me to ask Varun on Tuesday how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "phone interview with Google", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Varun on Tuesday how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t032-018", "text": "Femi and his wife both handed in their notice on the same day because they're moving to Lagos in the spring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "handed in their notice", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same day", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Lagos", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t032-019", "text": "Wei told me her manager, Karim, is leaving at the end of the month to go travelling. Nobody knows who's replacing him yet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "manager", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "go travelling", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t032-021", "text": "Rhys's performance review is on Wednesday at 11. He's convinced they're going to put him on a plan. Remind me to ring him Wednesday evening to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "performance review", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday at 11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "convinced they're going to put him on a plan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t032-023", "text": "Ethan mentioned his boss's wife just had twins, so the boss is off for six weeks and Ethan is covering.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had twins", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "covering", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t032-025", "text": "Rin has her final round with the consultancy in a fortnight. She asked if I could do a mock interview with her this weekend, maybe Sunday morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "final round with the consultancy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mock interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe Sunday morning", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t032-026", "text": "Callum is back at work after his knee operation. Still on crutches but in good spirits.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Callum", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on crutches", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in good spirits", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t032-027", "text": "Anjali passed her probation today. Drinks on Thursday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anjali", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "probation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t032-028", "text": "Bao's café job is ending when the place closes on the 30th. The owner is retiring and nobody wants to take it on. He's not sure what's next and seemed a bit low about it. He's been there since he left school. He mentioned he'd like to try something with cooking, maybe a commis chef role. Need to send him the details of that kitchen job Ethan mentioned.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "café job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "when the place closes on the 30th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "owner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit low", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "been there since he left school", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "like to try something with cooking, maybe a commis chef role", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him the details of that kitchen job Ethan mentioned", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t032-030", "text": "Got the rejection email from the housing association job. Onwards. Applying for the two charity roles this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "rejection email from the housing association job", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "two charity roles", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t032-033", "text": "Camila and her husband are both being made redundant from the same factory. The consultation meeting is on Tuesday at 9am. She's trying to stay positive for the kids. I want to take her for coffee after the meeting, maybe Tuesday lunchtime if she's up to it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant from the same factory", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "consultation meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday at 9am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to stay positive", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her for coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the meeting", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe Tuesday lunchtime", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t032-036", "text": "Michael Evans from the client side is leaving Petrov & Co. Their new account lead is Zoe Nakamura, starting on Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael Evans", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from the client side", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving Petrov & Co", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "account lead", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe Nakamura", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t032-038", "text": "Quick one: Ben is going for the team leader role. Applications close Friday at midnight and he still hasn't finished his statement. I need to read his draft tomorrow evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ben", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "team leader role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at midnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "read his draft", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t032-039", "text": "Krisztina said she'd love one of those fancy leather notebooks for her new office. Good leaving present idea.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love one of those fancy leather notebooks for her new office", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t032-042", "text": "Ines's mum is retiring from teaching next summer after nearly forty years. Ines wants to throw her a surprise party in July. I said I'd help with the playlist.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring from teaching", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in July", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t032-046", "text": "Anil's manager offered him the team lead role but only if he relocates to Leeds. He has until the end of next week to decide. His wife isn't keen. Need to call him over the weekend and talk it through.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "team lead role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the end of next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't keen", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him over the weekend and talk it through", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t032-048", "text": "Karim's leaving presentation was lovely. He cried a bit when they read out the messages from his old clients. Wei organised the whole thing and did an amazing job. He's got his first day at the new place on Monday morning, a startup in Shoreditch doing climate software. Must text him Monday evening to see how his first day went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving presentation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first day at the new place", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "startup in Shoreditch doing climate software", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t032-050", "text": "Darius has been signed off work with stress for two weeks. His manager has been awful to him since the restructure.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Darius", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "signed off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stress", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the restructure"}]}
{"id": "t032-051", "text": "Ethan's new job at the bike shop is going really well. He's already been asked to run the Saturday workshops and the owner hinted at making him assistant manager in the spring. It's such a change from last year when he was stuck in that call centre and miserable. His girlfriend Zoe says he comes home actually happy now. They're celebrating with dinner on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "job at the bike shop", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "asked to run the Saturday workshops", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "owner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "assistant manager", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "happy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t032-053", "text": "Callum said his manager is leaving in the new year and he's been asked to apply. Interviews are probably mid-January. Remind me to send him my old interview notes this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Callum", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Interviews", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably mid-January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him my old interview notes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t032-057", "text": "Oisín's uncle runs a building firm and might have something for him if the apprenticeship falls through.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "uncle", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "runs a building firm", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "apprenticeship", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
